            "description": "",
            "summary": "Shares of online study and academic help platform Chegg (NYSE:CHGG) jumped 5.3% in the afternoon session after the company reported third-quarter results that showed better-than-expected profitability and a strategic shift toward its growing skilling business, overshadowing a steep drop in overall revenue. Total revenue fell by 42% year-over-year to $78 million, but the company surpassed its adjusted EBITDA guidance by $5 million due to cost-cutting efforts. Chegg announced it was restructuring",
